# Two advisories. GO-2021-0113 fixes golang.org/x/text at v0.3.7, which resolves.
# GO-2020-0017 claims github.com/dgrijalva/jwt-go is fixed in v3.99.0, which was
# never published, so `go mod edit` accepts the requirement and `go mod tidy`
# cannot resolve it.
